## Our story

Savita Joshi started Annapurna Tiffins in 2019 with just 6 customers in Baner, Pune.

Her vision was simple: provide home-style vegetarian tiffins that taste like they're made at home.

Today, we cook and deliver about 240 tiffins daily to professionals in Baner, Aundh, Balewadi and Pashan.

Every meal is prepared with care, using traditional methods and quality ingredients.

Order or ask questions on WhatsApp at 98765 43210.

## What makes us special

- **Local & trusted**: Baner-based kitchen serving Baner, Aundh, Balewadi and Pashan areas
- **Flexible & convenient**: Pause your plan for free with 1 day notice, change or cancel anytime
- **Daily fresh menu**: Menu changes every day and is shared on WhatsApp at 9 pm for next day's meals
- **Inclusive options**: Jain meals available at the same price, prepared separately

## Join our tiffin family

Experience home-style vegetarian lunches delivered fresh to your door

**[Start Weekly Plan](https://wa.me/9876543210)**
